                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f6e0ddc9-3932-3762-98dc-65c1f199eda7",
                        "entry_id": "a01ff33e-5b58-35df-b167-3e6d3f8ad3f1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "van een zaak dat ze niet te ontkennen valt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bb58749-c7f9-4627-9f6c-c2778f957ee5",
                                "sense_id": "f6e0ddc9-3932-3762-98dc-65c1f199eda7",
                                "text": "Toch is er onloochenbaar een negatieve evolutie. Vroeger ontkenden de meeste Israëli’s de bezetting niet. Zo haalde wijlen Ariel Sharon, geen vredesduif, in de context van de terugtrekking uit Gaza in 2004 het woord ‘bezetting’ geregeld aan. In een recente peiling vond 54 procent van de ondervraagden dat Israëls controle over de Westoever niet omschreven kan worden als een bezetting."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e51f378c-3746-4f9a-abf8-4f54b45d3884",
                                "sense_id": "f6e0ddc9-3932-3762-98dc-65c1f199eda7",
                                "text": "Maar ook hij vervalt soms in politieke clichés. Dat is jammer. Vooral klip en klaar lijkt favoriet vandaag en ook Samsom bezondigt zich eraan. Alternatief nodig? Afgetekend, apert, evident, flagrant, helder, klaarblijkelijk, merkelijk, onbetwistbaar, ondubbelzinnig, onloochenbaar, onmiskenbaar, onomstotelijk, ontegenzeggelijk, onweerlegbaar, overduidelijk, zonneklaar. Sommige net zo archaïsch als klip en klaar. Dat is waar. Maar inmiddels is alles beter."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bd0b51ee-1037-4600-99ea-ed3b7b39fea4",
                        "source_entry_id": "a01ff33e-5b58-35df-b167-3e6d3f8ad3f1",
                        "source_sense_id": "f6e0ddc9-3932-3762-98dc-65c1f199eda7",
                        "source_sense_description": "van een zaak dat ze niet te ontkennen valt",
                        "target_lang_word": "undeniable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "undeniable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                                        "entry_id": "7d64e083-7e5a-357f-ae55-d06fb72bd135",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Irrefutable, or impossible to deny."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4cb309c2-3c4e-4d97-8ab6-634b7774a840",
                                                "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                                                "text": "Some believe that there is undeniable evidence of UFOs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47a91a15-04a2-4588-a407-6249cc4abfcd",
                                                "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                                                "text": "After all, it is undeniable that the B.R. standard coach scored highly in comparative trials with other European railway vehicles on the Continent a few years ago, so that B.R. civil engineers must share responsibility for any defects in its behaviour over here."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c779823d-f5b1-4424-956c-e1633cce697e",
                                                "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                                                "text": "If successful, Edison and Ford—in 1914—would move society away from the[…]hazards of gasoline cars: air and water pollution, noise and noxiousness, constant coughing and the undeniable rise in cancers caused by smoke exhaust particulates."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9c37f7b-06f8-4dad-a973-9625b411397d",
                                                "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                                                "text": "The connection between dictionaries and standardised forms of language is undeniable, yet, at the same time, not well understood."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db7530b7-c7ce-4c27-9e91-d22c553b7581",
                                                "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                                                "text": "The dispatches […] also exposed the blatant discrepancy between the west's professed values and actual foreign policies. Having lectured the Arab world about democracy for years, its collusion in suppressing freedom was undeniable as protesters were met by weaponry and tear gas made in the west, employed by a military trained by westerners."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
